# Input files for the "Generate Secrets.swift" build phase. Declaring the
# sources lets Xcode's build system skip the phase when nothing changed.
#
# The committed .age is the versioned source of the decrypted Secrets.swift the
# phase actually reads (via `a8c-secrets which`), so tracking it re-runs the
# phase after a pull that rotates the secret.
${SRCROOT}/Demo/Secrets.external-contributors.swift
${SRCROOT}/../.a8c-secrets/Secrets.swift.age
